  "contracts": [
    "Edge_catd_func and HomPresheaf_catd_func retain their already implemented CoAt2-shifted bases and Cartesian fibre classifiers.",
    "The retired ordinary Pi/Functor_catd Homd-target observations now name the actual Q-diagram transformation category Homd_target_section_cat; Homd_target_catd has its dimension-one transpose as fibre.",
    "Canonical covariance lands in the Hom of the Cartesian diagram category. Ordinary component evaluation observes it through strict_transfor; public Functord remains lax.",
    "Only the Op_funcd identity/involution/component consumers take the existing Cartesian map input and shifted base. All unrelated ordinary displayed maps and modifications retain their original generality.",
    "Higher components are strict transformations within Cat_cart. Their ordinary scalar observations use the existing inclusion, and their whole/category annotations use canonical Cartesian Homs.",
    "Conventional-lax transport selects the pre/right route. The generic agreement observations use the already implemented rhs comparison owners; the raw post/left boundary and its noninvertible comparison remain.",
    "The single old right-route point nonconversion becomes a positive under the selected conventional-lax contract. Three component-first pre/right runtime negatives remain normalization diagnostics, not semantic non-naturality claims."
  ],
